# Storage nearly full
name: storage-nearly-full
version: 1
capacity: 10
description: Store reaches NEARLY_FULL at 90% capacity; next read still succeeds.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
repeat 9
  read CHIP
  advance_ms 3000
end
assert store_status NEARLY_FULL
assert observations 9
assert next_sequence 10
read CHIP
assert store_status FULL
assert observations 10
assert next_sequence 11